<title>USA: Bandag names Heidbreder CFO.</title>
<headline>Bandag names Heidbreder CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCATINE, Iowa 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bandag Inc said Tuesday its board of directors elected Warren Heidbreder chief financial officer.</p>
<p>He will replace Thomas Dvorchak, who will retire as chief financial officer January 1, the company said.  </p>
<p>Dvorchak, who has been chief financial officer since 1978, plans to remain with the company through 1997 to assist with the transition and to manage special projects for Bandag's chairman, the truck tire retreading company said.</p>
<p>Heidbreder has been with Bandag in 1982 and has served as vice president, legal and tax Administration and corporate secretary since 1986.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
